{"success": true, "data": {"id": 6, "displayOrder": 18, "titleKo": "신주의 제3자 배정 공고", "titleEn": "Announcement of Third-Party Allocation of New Shares", "titleJa": "新州の第三者配分公告", "titleZh": "第三方配售新股公告", "contentKo": "<div>\n  <p><b>주식회사 무신사카피</b><br />\n신주의 제3자 배정 공고\n  </p>\n</div><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>주식회사 무신사카피는 주주 외의 자에 대한 신주 배정을 아래와 같이 공고합니다. </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>1.      신주의종류 및 수: 제3종 상환전환우선주식 130,766 주</p><p>2.      신주의발행가액: 1주당 금 1,529,447원</p><p>3.      신주의납입기일: 2023년 8월 18일</p><p>4.      신주의인수방법: 정관 제11조 제2항에 따라 제3자 배정방식으로 아래와 같이 배정한다.</p><p>&zwj;</p><div><table style=\"width:765px\" class=\"tg\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">신주인수인</th><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">배정주식수</th><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">인수금액</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">KKR Melange Holdings L.P.</td><td style=\"background-color:#FFF;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">65,383주</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">금 99,999,833,201원(1주당 금 1,529,447원)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">Wellington Hadley Harbor Aggregator IV, L.P</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">65,383주</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">금 99,999,833,201원(1주당 금 1,529,447원)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><div>\n  <p>2023년   8월   1일\n  <br /><br />\n주식회사 무신사카피<br />\n서울특별시 성동구 아차산로13길 11, 1층(성수동2가, 무신사카피캠퍼스 엔1)<br />\n대표이사 한 문 일\n\n  </p>\n</div>", "contentEn": "<div>\n  <p><b>Musinsa Co., Ltd.</b><br />\nNotice of Third-Party Allocation of New Shares\n</p>\n</div><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>Musinsa Co., Ltd. announces the allocation of new shares to persons other than shareholders as follows.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>1. Type and number of new shares: 130,766 shares of Class 3 redeemable convertible preferred stock</p><p>2.      New stock issuance price: KRW 1,529,447 per share</p><p>3.      New share payment due date: August 18, 2023</p><p>4.      Method of subscription to new shares: Allocate as follows through the third-party allocation method in accordance with Article 11, Paragraph 2 of the Articles of Incorporation.</p><p>&zwj;</p><div><table style=\"width:765px\" class=\"tg\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">New shareholder</th><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">Number of allocated shares</th><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">Acquisition amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">KKR Melange Holdings L.P.</td><td style=\"background-color:#FFF;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">65,383 weeks</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">99,999,833,201 won in gold (1,529,447 won per week)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">Wellington Hadley Harbor Aggregator IV, L.P.</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">65,383 weeks</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">99,999,833,201 won in gold (1,529,447 won per week)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><div>\n  <p>August 1, 2023<br /><br />Musinsa Co., Ltd.<br />11, Achasan-ro 13-gil, 1st floor, Seongdong-gu, Seoul (Seongsu-dong 2-ga, Musinsa Campus N1)<br />\nCEO Han Moon-il\n\n</p>\n</div>", "contentJa": "<div>\n  <p><b>株式会社無神社</b><br />\n新州の第三者配分公告\n  </p>\n</div><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>株式会社無神社は、株主以外の者に対する新株配分を以下のように公告します。 </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>1.     新州の種類と数：第3種返済転換優先株式130,766株</p><p>2.     新州の発行価額：1株当たり金1,529,447ウォン</p><p>3.     新州の納入期日：2023年8月18日</p><p>4.     新株主の買収方法：定款第11条第2項の規定により第三者配分方式で以下のように配分する。</p><p>&zwj;</p><div><table style=\"width:765px\" class=\"tg\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">新株引受人</th><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">割り当て株式数</th><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">買収金額</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">KKR Melange Holdings L.P.</td><td style=\"background-color:#FFF;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">65,383株</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">金99,999,833,201ウォン（1週間あたり1,529,447ウォン）</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">Wellington Hadley Harbor Aggregator IV, L.P</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">65,383株</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">金99,999,833,201ウォン（1週間あたり1,529,447ウォン）</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><div>\n  <p>2023年8月1日\n  <br /><br />\n株式会社無神社<br />\nソウル特別市城東区嘉茶山路13道11、1階（城水洞2街、武神寺キャンパス円1）<br />\n代表取締役\n\n  </p>\n</div>", "contentZh": "<div>\n  <p><b>穆辛萨有限公司</b><br />第三方配售新股通知\n\n</p>\n</div><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>Musinsa有限公司宣布向股东以外的人士分配新股如下。</p><p>和</p><p>1. 新股类型及数量：130,766股3类可赎回可转换优先股</p><p>2. 新股发行价：每股 1,529,447 韩元</p><p>3. 新股款支付到期日：2023年8月18日</p><p>4. 认购新股的方法：按照公司章程第11条第2款的规定，通过第三方分配方法进行如下分配。</p><p>&zwj;</p><div><table style=\"width:765px\" class=\"tg\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">新股东</th><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">已分配股份数量</th><th style=\"background-color:#efefef;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">收购金额</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">KKR Melange Holdings L.P.</td><td style=\"background-color:#FFF;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">65,383 周</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">赢得黄金99,999,833,201枚（每周赢得1,529,447枚）</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">Wellington Hadley Harbor Aggregator IV, L.P.</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">65,383 周</td><td style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#333;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;text-align:center\">赢得黄金99,999,833,201枚（每周赢得1,529,447枚）</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><div>\n  <p>2023年8月1日<br /><br />穆辛萨有限公司<br />首尔市城东区峨嵯山路13街11号1楼（圣水洞2街，武信寺校区N1）<br />韩文日首席执行官\n\n</p>\n</div>", "thumbnailUrl": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/notice_6_thumbnail.jpg", "linkUrl": null, "linkTarget": null, "publishedAt": "2023-08-01T00:00:00.000Z", "date": "2023.08.01", "visibleKo": true, "visibleEn": false, "visibleJa": false, "visibleZh": false}}